      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Nathalie Baye tries to spoil her audition so she will not have to act with her daughter. At the agency, assistant Noemie offers director Solveig Akerfelt a long list of drinks; the director only wants water. The original reading is shared with the director, but Nathalie reads both dramatic parts in this shortened French retelling. Listen for how she ignores the request for less drama.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "solveig",
      "t": "Non, merci. Un verre d'eau.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Non, Nathalie, tu ne peux pas faire ça.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nathalie",
      "t": "Bien sûr que oui.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
