      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nathalie",
      "t": "Tu as toujours aimé le vent.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "solveig",
      "t": "Tu peux réessayer, sans tant de tragédie?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "solveig",
      "t": "Quelque chose de plus neutre.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nathalie",
      "t": "Si c'est ce que tu veux.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nathalie",
      "t": "Depuis que tu es petite, je le savais.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "nathalie",
      "t": "C'est plus neutre?",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "solveig",
      "t": "Non, merci. Un verre d'eau.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, thank you. A glass of water.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Non, Nathalie, tu ne peux pas faire ça.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, Nathalie, you can't do that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nathalie",
      "t": "Bien sûr que oui.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Of course I can.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "mathias",
      "t": "Tu ne sais même pas comment faire.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You don't even know how to do it.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nathalie",
      "t": "Qu'est-ce que tu en sais, Mathias?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What do you know about it, Mathias?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nathalie",
      "t": "C'est très poétique. Je suis très émue.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It's very poetic. I'm very moved.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nathalie",
      "t": "Bon, j'y vais.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Right, here I go.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "nathalie",
      "t": "Mais c'est toi qui veux partir.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'But you're the one who wants to leave.'",
